                <mxCell id="ob_note_process" value="&lt;b&gt;Worker work (per-sensor dataloader)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;· move raw files → allotrope_data/scenes/&amp;lt;scene_id&amp;gt;/raw/&lt;br/&gt;· parse metadata (HE5 / TIF / EnMAP folder)&lt;br/&gt;· &lt;b&gt;build VendableDataset&lt;/b&gt; → allotrope_data/scenes/&amp;lt;scene_id&amp;gt;/vendable/&lt;br/&gt;· derive bbox, native_projection, band_count&lt;br/&gt;· compute cloud_cover_pct where available&lt;br/&gt;· generate thumbnail → allotrope_artifacts/thumbnails/&lt;br/&gt;· validate required fields" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
